Expected: all succeed. If `npm run typecheck` reports a type mismatch on `L.Control.Draw`, `L.Draw.Event`, or `L.DrawEvents.Created` that isn't resolvable by a small, well-reasoned adjustment, read `node_modules/@types/leaflet-draw/index.d.ts` directly (it's a real, verified-installable package — do not guess at its shape, read it) — the shapes in this task's code were verified against that file's actual contents at plan-writing time, but package versions can drift.

